# A door that cuts its own opening (see docs/editor/mesh-editing.md#cutters-and-cut-targets): the swinging leaf of the
# shadow cache scene, and an opening a little larger than the leaf, whose Mesh_Cutter cuts every wall with a Cut_Target
# that it overlaps. The root is at the floor, in the middle of the doorway. The leaf is a kinematic body, so it pushes
# what it meets as it swings and the navmesh bake does not plug the opening with it. The opening is under the root,
# not under the leaf, so it keeps its own scale and does not swing.
scene 3

entity 1000000000000001
name = "Door"
component 1 Transform
	position = [0, 0, 0]
	rotation = [0, 0, 0, 1]
	scale = [1, 1, 1]

entity 1000000000000002
name = "Leaf"
parent = @1000000000000001
